msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Ya want a lift to the airport, Kiryu-chan? Ya ain't been in\r\n"
"the lap of luxury 'til ya ride in the back of a Majima Family car!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"...I think I'll be fine with just a taxi. Thanks though,\r\n"
"Majima-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Suit yourself. Oh, and don't go worryin' about the Tojo when\r\n"
"you're gone. I'll make sure everythin' stays nice and tidy. Promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Ya ever need a hand or a hundred from the Majima Family, just gimme a ring. "
"We'll be down there before ya even hang up the phone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Thanks, Majima-san... but I think I'll be okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Hmph. Just don't let Mine or those CIA assholes get the better of you, ya "
"hear? You're not allowed to go down 'til I bring ya down myself!"
msgstr ""

